WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:05.538
- MR. COOK, YOU'RE ALMOST UP.
ARE YOU READY?

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:08.074
- GOOD. I'M GOOD.
- OKAY.

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:09.575
REALLY GONNA NEED YOU TO STICK
TO THE SCRIPT ON THIS ONE.

00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:11.377
- I'M THE CEO OF APPLE,
WILLIS.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.413
I'M NOT GONNA
DO ANYTHING STUPID.

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.281
PLEASE STOP COMPARING ME
TO STEVE JOBS.

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:17.383
- NO, BUT NOBODY'S COMPARING YOU
TO STEVE JOBS, OKAY?

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:19.085
WE JUST WANT YOU
TO FOCUS ON THE PRODUCTS

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:20.386
AND PLEASE STICK
TO THE SCRIPT.

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:22.455
OKAY, YOU'RE ON IN THREE--

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:25.224
- THEY'RE GONNA FORGET THEY EVER
HEARD THE NAME STEVE JOBS.

00:00:25.257 --> 00:00:27.493
WHAT UP, APPLE PEOPLE?

00:00:27.526 --> 00:00:29.362
[cheers and applause]

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:31.431
YEAH!

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:32.698 line:92%
YEAH!

00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:34.801
WELL, NOW THE FIRST THING

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:39.138
THAT I'M GONNA DO
IS T.O.T.S.

00:00:39.171 --> 00:00:42.208
THROW OUT THE SCRIPT.

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:45.311
[cheers and applause]

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:50.216
NOW, I'M SUPPOSED TO COME OUT
HERE AND TELL YOU ABOUT SOME

00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:54.520
BULL[bleep] NEW IPHONE, PAD,
POD, DICK, PUSSY [bleep]!

00:00:54.553 --> 00:00:57.290
YOU'VE SEEN IT!
[stammering] BORING!

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.458
[clattering]

00:00:58.491 --> 00:00:59.358
[applause]

00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:00.626
YES!

00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:03.196
THAT'S EXACTLY IT.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:06.799
NOW, LET'S JUST SAY
THIS TABLE RIGHT HERE--

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:09.535
LET'S SAY IT'S BILL GATES, HUH?
[shouts]

00:01:09.568 --> 00:01:11.204
[audience cheers]

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:13.339
YEAH!

00:01:13.372 --> 00:01:15.374
[yelping]

00:01:15.407 --> 00:01:17.210
[laughs]

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.178
THAT'S WHAT I'M TALKING ABOUT!

00:01:19.211 --> 00:01:22.381
AND LET'S SAY THAT THIS

00:01:22.414 --> 00:01:26.319
IS OUR COMPETITOR'S
NEW SMARTPHONE.

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:29.222
[audience boos]

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.258
HOW ABOUT THAT?
HUH? WHAT?

00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:34.560
[laughs]

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:36.629
[robot voice]
I AM A MAJOR DONKEY DICK.

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:39.365
WHOO! RIGHT?

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:40.333
AND LET'S SAY
THAT THIS RIGHT HERE...

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:42.335
- HEY!

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:43.569
- THIS IS ONE
OF OUR COMPETITOR'S

00:01:43.602 --> 00:01:45.905
NEW E-BOOK READER, HUH?

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.607
WHAT ABOUT THAT?

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.143
WHAT? UH-OH.
TUT-TUT.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:52.445
WOOK'S WIKE WAIN!

00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:55.748
HAAAA!

00:01:55.781 --> 00:01:59.318
[cheers and applause]

00:01:59.351 --> 00:02:03.356
WHOO! WHOO!

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:05.424
YEAH!

00:02:05.457 --> 00:02:07.226
ALL RIGHT!

00:02:07.259 --> 00:02:09.428
YES!

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:11.497
WHO WANTS TO SEE SOME OF THAT
CLASSIFIED NEXT-LEVEL [bleep]?

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.499
HUH?

00:02:13.532 --> 00:02:15.501
DID STEVE EVER SHOW YOU
THAT CLASSIFIED [bleep]?

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:17.570
NO, HE DIDN'T.

00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:19.472
- YOU CAN'T DO THAT.
THEY HAVEN'T BEEN TESTED YET.

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:21.307
- THIS DEVICE WILL ALLOW YOU
TO TELEPORT

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:23.609
ANYWHERE ON THE PLANET.

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:24.944
CHECK THIS OUT.

00:02:24.977 --> 00:02:27.947
I AM THE FUTURE!

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.949
[beeps, buzzes]

00:02:29.982 --> 00:02:31.517
[screams]

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:32.518
- [gasps]

00:02:32.551 --> 00:02:34.154
- [screams]

00:02:36.488 --> 00:02:38.457
- WHOO!

00:02:38.490 --> 00:02:42.495
LET'S SEE STEVE JOBS DO THAT!
[laughs]

